    instruction cannot resolve into a ≥15-digit numeral by tightening the continuum instrument; it
    FIRST requires the ℝ-descent of the dominant free parameter `s`. -/
theorem no_narrow_bracket (j lo hi : Cut)
    (h2 : dressedInvAlphaEMJoin depthWeight (1 / 2) j (completeBandList chargeTraceDepth) ≤ hi)
    (h3 : lo ≤ dressedInvAlphaEMJoin depthWeight (3 / 2) j (completeBandList chargeTraceDepth)) :
    (1 : Cut) < hi - lo := by
  have hgap := composed_numeral_unpinnable j
  linarith

/-! ## (E) W8 NON-VACUITY WITH TEETH. -/

/-- ★★ W8 — THE ADMISSIBLE POINTS LIE IN THE BANKED OPEN RANGE: both `s = 1/2` and `s = 3/2` satisfy
